<title>INDIA: Indian soybean prices mixed, selling by refineries.</title>
<headline>Indian soybean prices mixed, selling by refineries.</headline>
<dateline>INDORE, India 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian soybean prices were mixed on Friday on dull trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>Soyoil solvent fell by 800 rupees per tonne and soyoil refined by 600 rupees on limited demand against heavy selling from processing plants and refineries.</p>
<p>Soymeal and rapeseed extraction prices were steady with soymeal yellow traded at $300-302 per tonne for September-October shipment. Soymeal yellow for November to January shipments was quoted at 280-282. Rapeseed extraction was $133. Rapeseed extraction was 4,600 rupees FOR Bedibunder and was 4,550-4,575 rupees FOR Bhavnagar.</p>
